{"unit_id": "tag:01QF:statement", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是概形（scheme）。假设存在有限多个元素（elements）<MATH_0002>，使得\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002>每个<MATH_0003>都是<MATH_0004>的仿射开集（affine open），并且\n<STRUCT_0003>由<MATH_0005>在<MATH_0006>中生成的理想（ideal）等于单位理想（ideal）。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n则<MATH_0007>是仿射（affine）的。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "elements", "target_term": "元素"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形", "context": "命题中的给定对象"}, {"source_term": "elements", "target_term": "元素", "context": "假设存在的有限多个对象"}, {"source_term": "affine open", "target_term": "仿射开集", "context": "第一项条件中的开集"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想", "context": "第二项条件中由给定元素生成的理想"}, {"source_term": "ideal", "target_term": "理想", "context": "第二项条件中的单位理想"}, {"source_term": "affine", "target_term": "仿射", "context": "结论中概形的性质"}], "notes": []}
