{"unit_id": "tag:01QG:prose-0001", "translation": "\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n本节的主题是，若存在一个丰沛（ample）可逆（invertible）层（sheaf），则每个拟凝聚层（quasi-coherent sheaf）都来自一个分次（graded）模（module）。\n\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "ample", "target_term": "丰沛"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模"}], "unknown_terms": [{"source_term": "ample", "target_term": "丰沛", "context": "作为存在条件的可逆层的性质"}, {"source_term": "invertible", "target_term": "可逆", "context": "存在条件中对层的限定"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层", "context": "存在条件中的对象"}, {"source_term": "quasi-coherent sheaf", "target_term": "拟凝聚层", "context": "结论中由全称量词限定的对象"}, {"source_term": "graded", "target_term": "分次", "context": "结论中对模的限定"}, {"source_term": "module", "target_term": "模", "context": "结论中拟凝聚层所来自的对象"}], "notes": []}
